I agree, I'm just starting to learn lojban and have found a dearth of 
good transliterated lojbanic text to play with. There seems to be so 
much more about lojban than in it. I had considered learning lojban many 
years ago but was scared off at the time by the great loglan/lojban 
falling out. (It started to sound a little bit too esperanto to me. )

